OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 402 Fri 20 NovC07:57/20
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4   
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'My son will die without cannabis 
OL,4,Amedication'                            
OL,6,FBen has severe drug-resistant epilepsy 
OL,7,Fand has been prescribed medicinal      
OL,8,Fcannabis in the form of Bedrolite and  
OL,9,FBedica oils for the last seven years,  
OL,10,Fbut Bedrocan, the Dutch pharmacy       
OL,11,Fdispensing the UK-prescribed medicines,
OL,12,Fis set to close on 1 December.         
OL,14,F"My son is going to die," Joanne said, 
OL,15,Fadding that Ben has about "five weeks" 
OL,16,Fof medication left.                    
